---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <div class="content article-page">

    <div class="card">
      <h1 class="article-title">
        Exciting New Updates in MyProfitLand: Weapon Stacking & War Specialist+ Enhancements
      </h1>
      <p class="meta">
        By <span class="gold-text">Mina Boles</span> · February 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img 
        class="article-image" 
        src="imgs/weaponssetstake.jpeg" 
        alt="Weapon stacking update in MyProfitLand"
      >
    </div>

    <div class="card article-body">

      <p>
        <strong>MyProfitLand</strong> has introduced powerful new updates designed to reshape combat strategy 
        and give players more control over their equipment. 
        Announced on February 14, these improvements focus on two major additions:
        <strong>Weapon Stacking</strong> and <strong>War Specialist+</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>Weapon Stacking: Strengthen What You Already Own</h2>

      <p>
        One of the most requested features is finally here. Instead of replacing a weapon 
        when purchasing a duplicate, players can now increase its durability.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Stack Durability:</strong> Buying the same equipped weapon adds durability 
          to the existing one instead of replacing it.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Maximum Boost:</strong> Durability can stack up to <strong>3× the base value</strong>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Balance Condition:</strong> Stacking is only available when your current weapon 
          durability drops below <strong>70%</strong> of its maximum.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        This change rewards smart timing and strategic planning. 
        Instead of wasting duplicates, players can now build long-lasting weapons 
        and reduce unnecessary replacements.
      </p>

      <h2>War Specialist+: Tactical Advantage Upgraded</h2>

      <p>
        The War Specialist+ enhancement introduces improved combat efficiency, 
        giving serious fighters an edge in high-intensity battles. 
        While maintaining balance, this update ensures experienced players 
        can maximize their strategic potential.
      </p>

      <p>
        Together, these updates mark a significant evolution in the game's combat mechanics, 
        encouraging smarter resource management and more calculated decision-making.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
